Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.10,0:00:02.94,English,en-0,0,0,0,,{\q2}Replenishment also has an order of operations.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.10,0:00:02.41,Chinese,zh-0,0,0,0,,{\q2}补员还有先后顺序。
Dialogue: 2,0:00:02.41,0:00:06.59,Chinese,zh-1,0,0,0,,{\q2}普通准备阶段，会根据固定物理槽的条件，
Dialogue: 1,0:00:02.94,0:00:06.46,English,en-1,0,0,0,,{\q2}The normal preparation phase saves this round's prepared
Dialogue: 1,0:00:06.46,0:00:09.85,English,en-2,0,0,0,,{\q2}fraction according to conditions in the fixed physical
Dialogue: 2,0:00:06.59,0:00:10.77,Chinese,zh-2,0,0,0,,{\q2}把本轮准备比例保存下来；某些类型先检查
Dialogue: 1,0:00:09.85,0:00:10.16,English,en-3,0,0,0,,{\q2}slot.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:10.16,0:00:15.47,English,en-4,0,0,0,,{\q2}Some types first check current permission; some definition branches bypass that check.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:10.77,0:00:14.74,Chinese,zh-3,0,0,0,,{\q2}当前许可，有些定义分支会绕过这一关。
Dialogue: 2,0:00:14.74,0:00:18.69,Chinese,zh-4,0,0,0,,{\q2}真正计算补员请求时，游戏读取已经保存
Dialogue: 1,0:00:15.47,0:00:19.76,English,en-5,0,0,0,,{\q2}When calculating the actual replenishment request, the game reads the
Dialogue: 2,0:00:18.69,0:00:22.64,Chinese,zh-5,0,0,0,,{\q2}的比例，再检查各个物理槽的当前条件。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:19.76,0:00:24.11,English,en-6,0,0,0,,{\q2}stored fraction, then checks current conditions in each physical slot.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:22.64,0:00:27.03,Chinese,zh-6,0,0,0,,{\q2}因此，当前计算出的比例、已经保存的比例和
Dialogue: 1,0:00:24.11,0:00:27.50,English,en-7,0,0,0,,{\q2}The currently calculated fraction, the stored fraction
Dialogue: 2,0:00:27.03,0:00:31.20,Chinese,zh-7,0,0,0,,{\q2}最后新增人数，是三个需要分别读取的数。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:27.50,0:00:30.58,English,en-8,0,0,0,,{\q2}and the final number added must therefore be read
Dialogue: 1,0:00:30.58,0:00:31.27,English,en-9,0,0,0,,{\q2}separately.
